msgstr "1 KĄ GALITE DARYTI SU KOREADER?"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:1347-6
#| msgid ""
#| "Despite its minimalistic looks, KOReader is a very powerful and "
#| "customizable application. This section is like a table of contents which "
#| "is how-to oriented. So if you are a new user, this is the best place to "
#| "start. Here you can read what KOReader can do and learn how to do it by "
#| "following these <a href=\"#L1-whatcanyoudo\" class=\"internalink\"></a> "
#| "links to go to the mentioned sections."
msgid ""
"Despite its minimalistic looks, KOReader is a very powerful and customizable "
"application. This section is like a <b>how-to oriented</b> table of "
"contents. So if you are a new user, this is the best place to start. Here "
"you can discover what KOReader can do and learn how to do it by following "
"the links."
msgstr ""
"Nepaisant minimalistinės išvaizdos, KOReader yra labai galinga ir pritaikoma "
"programa. Šis skyrius yra tarsi turinys, orientuotas į praktinius nurodymus. "
"Taigi, jei esate naujas naudotojas, tai geriausia vieta pradėti. Čia galite "
"paskaityti, ką gali KOReader, ir sužinoti, kaip tai padaryti, sekdami šias "
"<a href=\"#L1-whatcanyoudo\" class=\"internalink\"></a> nuorodas į "
"atitinkamus skyrius."

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:1350-6
#| msgid ""
#| "<span class=\"label_blue\">INFO</span> Name of KOReader comes from the "
#| "beginnings of the project: <b>K</b>indle/<b>K</b>obo <b>O</b>pen Reader. "
#| "Of course the reader grew so much over the years, now an accurate "
#| "abbreviation would be something like <b>KKPRCSALMOReader</b> (Kindle Kobo "
#| "Pocketbook Remarkable Cervantes Sony Android Linux MacOS Open reader) but "
#| "this is not that nice to pronounce, so we choose to keep it simple :)"
msgid ""
"<span class=\"microns_info\" title=\"Contextual information\"></span> Name "
"of KOReader comes from the beginnings of the project: <b>K</b>indle/<b>K</"
"b>obo <b>O</b>pen Reader. Of course the reader grew so much over the years, "
"now an accurate abbreviation would be something like <b>KKPRCSALMOReader</b> "
"(Kindle Kobo Pocketbook Remarkable Cervantes Sony Android Linux MacOS Open "
"reader) but this is not that nice to pronounce, so we choose to keep it "
"simple :)"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"label_blue\">INFO</span> KOReader pavadinimas kilo iš projekto "
"pradžios: <b>K</b>indle/<b>K</b>obo <b>O</b>pen Reader. Žinoma, per metus "
"skaityklė taip išaugo, kad dabar tikslesnė santrumpa būtų kažkas panašaus į "
"<b>KKPRCSALMOReader</b> (Kindle Kobo Pocketbook Remarkable Cervantes Sony "
"Android Linux MacOS Open reader), tačiau tai nėra taip malonu tarti, todėl "
"nusprendėme palikti paprastą pavadinimą :)"

