"<span class=\"ui\">ĮRANKIAI:</span> Šiame meniu yra įskiepiai, galintys "
"išplėsti KOReader funkcionalumą."

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:2188-7
#| msgid ""
#| "<span class=\"ui\">SEARCH:</span> This menu contains items related to "
#| "search and lookup. <b>Text search, dictionary, translation, Wikipedia...</"
#| "b>"
