"<span class=\"ui\">PAIEŠKA:</span> Šiame meniu yra elementai, susiję su "
"paieška ir žodynu. <b>Teksto paieška, žodynas, vertimas, Wikipedija...</b>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:2192-7
#| msgid ""
#| "<span class=\"ui\">FILE BROWSER:</span> This button opens the <span "
#| "class=\"ui\">file browser</span> which is the interface for managing your "
#| "library."
msgid ""
"<span class=\"ui\">FILE BROWSER</span> This button opens the <span "
"class=\"ui\">file browser</span> which is the interface for managing your "
"library."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"ui\">FAILŲ NARŠYKLĖ:</span> Šis mygtukas atidaro <span "
"class=\"ui\">failų naršyklę</span>, kuri yra bibliotekos tvarkymo sąsaja."

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:2197-7
#| msgid ""
#| "<span class=\"ui\">MAIN:</span> This menu contains tools for accessing "
