msgid "Optimizing battery health"
msgstr "Baterijos veikimo trukmės optimizavimas"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:7474-6
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Li-ion batteries experience more degradation at the extreme ends of their "
#| "charge levels. To minimize this degradation and extend your battery life, "
#| "you can limit your minimum discharge level to <b>20%</b> and maximum "
#| "charge level to <b>80%</b> (as in electric vehicles and some newer "
#| "phones). Which means you start charging your device when the battery goes "
#| "down to 20% and unplug when it reaches 80% (or 25%-75% if you are extra "
#| "cautious)."
msgid ""
"Li-ion batteries experience more degradation at the extreme ends of their "
"charge levels. To minimize this degradation and extend your battery life, "
"you can limit your minimum discharge level to <b>20%</b> and maximum charge "
"level to <b>80%</b> (as in electric vehicles and some newer phones). Which "
"means you start charging your device when the battery goes down to 20% and "
"unplug when it reaches 80% (or 30%-70% if you are extra cautious)."
msgstr ""
"Ličio jonų baterijos labiau nusidėvi esant kraštutiniams įkrovimo lygiams. "
"Norėdami sumažinti šį nusidėvėjimą ir pailginti baterijos veikimo trukmę, "
"galite apriboti minimalų iškrovimo lygį iki <b>20%</b> ir maksimalų įkrovimo "
"lygį iki <b>80%</b> (kaip elektromobiliuose ir kai kuriuose naujesniuose "
"telefonuose). Tai reiškia, kad įrenginį pradedate krauti, kai baterija "
"nukrenta iki 20%, ir atjungiate, kai pasiekia 80% (arba 25%-75%, jei esate "
"itin atsargūs)."

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:7478-6
